 WEB SCRABING

Project Overview

This project is completed as part of the CodeAlpha Data Analytics Internship.

The objective of this task is to collect book-related information from a website using Web Scraping techniques and store the collected data in a structured format.

Objective

- Scrape book information from a website.
- Extract relevant details such as title, price, rating, and availability.
- Store the collected data in a CSV file.
- Prepare the dataset for further analysis.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Requests
- BeautifulSoup
- Google Colab

Data Collected

The dataset contains the following information:

- Book Title
- Price
- Rating
- Availability

Output

The scraped book data was collected and stored in a CSV dataset for further data analysis.

